"releaseNotes":"Vault Refresh: The vault screen has been redesigned. Filtering is easier to reach, and the active filter is always shown so you know what you are looking at. Your account controls and settings have moved into a new avatar menu, and both folder view and list view have been refreshed.\n\nFaster Navigation: A new bottom tab bar puts your vault, two-factor codes, Security Audit, BreachWatch, and search a single tap away.\n\nRedesigned Screens: Two-factor codes, Security Audit, and search have all been rebuilt to be clearer and faster.\n\nSmarter Autofill: Keeper can suggest a strong password right in the iOS password prompt and save the record for you.\n\nVarious bug fixes.", "artistId":287170075, "artistName":"Callpod Inc.", "genres":["Productivity", "Business"], "price":0.00, "bundleId":"D4D2433BGC", "genreIds":["6007", "6000"], "primaryGenreName":"Productivity", "primaryGenreId":6007, "releaseDate":"2019-02-12T08:00:00Z", "minimumOsVersion":"17.0", "trackId":287170072, "trackName":"Keeper Password Manager", "sellerName":"Callpod Inc.", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "version":"18.1.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Keeper is a secure password manager and digital vault trusted by 5,000,000+ people and 100,000+ businesses globally. Rated 4.9 stars by 228,000 people, Keeper combines enterprise-grade security with real human support to protect your passwords, passkeys, files and private information. Named Best Password Manager of 2026 by CNET, and the Top-Ranked Identity Security Solution by Newsweek.\n\nPASSWORD MANAGER FOR EVERYDAY SECURITY\nCreate strong, unique passwords and passphrases with Keeper’s password generator. Save them in your encrypted password vault, autofill logins across apps and websites and unlock your digital life with Face ID or Touch ID.\n\nPASSKEYS AND 2FA\nCreate and save passkeys that sync across your devices. Store two-factor authentication codes directly in Keeper for fast, secure, one-tap logins without a separate authenticator app.\n\nWORLD-CLASS SECURITY\nEvery record is encrypted on your device before it ever touches our servers – unreadable to everyone, including Keeper. Protect your vault with hardware security keys such as YubiKey® and remotely lock or wipe a lost device.\n\nKeeper supports zero-knowledge security and advanced encryption, including quantum-resistant cryptography for data in transit. Keeper is SOC 2 Type I and II; ISO 27001, 27017 and 27018 certified; FedRAMP High Certified; GovRAMP High Authorized; and recognized in the Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Privileged Access Management.\n\nMORE THAN JUST PASSWORDS\nKeeper is your complete digital vault. Store and organize payment cards, passports, driver’s licenses, insurance cards, secure notes, SSH keys, software licenses, medical records and other important documents alongside your passwords.\n\nEverything is encrypted, searchable and available across your devices. Automatically fill payment details, addresses and forms on websites and in apps.\n\nSECURE SHARING\nShare passwords, passkeys or files with anyone – even people who do not use Keeper – with a One-Time Share link that expires automatically. Set view-only or edit access, revoke access instantly and organize credentials in shared folders with nested subfolders and individual permissions.\n\nDARK WEB MONITORING\nBreachWatch® continuously scans the dark web and alerts you when one of your accounts appears in a data breach, so you can change the password before cybercriminals use it. Monitoring runs within Keeper’s secure infrastructure, so your personal data stays private.\n\nPERFECT FOR FAMILIES\nKeeper Family includes five private vaults, 10GB of secure file storage, unlimited devices and emergency access.\n\nSafely store Wi-Fi passwords, streaming logins, insurance documents and passport photos in one place for everyone you trust.\n\n24/7 EXPERT SUPPORT\nGet help from a real Keeper expert anytime. Our dedicated support team is available around the clock, every day of the year.\n\nGET STARTED QUICKLY\nSeamlessly import passwords, passkeys and other records from iCloud Keychain, Chrome, 1Password, LastPass, Bitwarden, Dashlane and more, including direct secure transfer from other apps.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://keepersecurity.com/privacypolicy.html\nTerms of Use: https://keepersecurity.com/termsofuse.html", "trackCensoredName":"Keeper Password Manager", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/keeper-password-manager/id287170072?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.89618000000000019866774891852401196956634521484375, "userRatingCount":231964}, 
