"releaseNotes":"- The text shown when setting up Apple Watch complications now appears in your preferred language. [[#ME-1180]] [[#ME-1186]] [[#ME-1192]]\n- We've improved the design of the search field on the New Item screen.\n- We've removed the Tips section from the Home screen.\n- When you select the Search tab on iOS 26 or later, the keyboard now automatically appears. Swipe down to dismiss the keyboard or cancel the search to return to the tab you were on before. [[#EE-1733]] [[#EE-1963]] [[#EE-2519]]\n- We've fixed an issue that could prevent you from seeing the suggestions shown above the keyboard when editing an item on iOS 27. [[#EE-2534]] [[#EE-2533]] [[#AP-174]]\n- We've fixed an issue where a temporary connection problem could prompt you to set up a recovery code even if you already had one.\n- We've fixed an issue where you could delete your only working recovery code if you have a 1Password account that signs in with a passkey and you also had an older, inactive recovery code.\n- We've fixed an issue where the lock screen in the Autofill pop-up sometimes wouldn't automatically select the password field or prompt for biometrics. [[#ME-1165]]\n- We've fixed an issue where opening the link to create a diagnostics report wouldn't work. [[#ME-873]] [[#ME-1202]] [[#ME-1203]] [[#ME-1207]]\n- We've fixed an issue where \"Autofill\" was capitalized as \"AutoFill\" in Settings. [[#ME-1144]]\n- We've fixed an issue where the Autofill pop-up could appear blank after the screen changed size, like when you rotated your device to landscape mode. [[#ME-990]]\n- We've fixed an issue where the 1Password app on Apple Watch wouldn't open. [[#ME-1221]]\n- We've fixed an issue where 1Password could fail to start if a damaged local cache couldn't be removed.\n- We've fixed a crash that could occur when you selected an item in a list while the contents were changing quickly.", "artistId":285897621, "artistName":"AgileBits Inc.", "genres":["Productivity", "Utilities"], "price